# CONTINUOUS NATIVE GENERATION (#996 CNG wave).
#
# `ios/` and `android/` are OUTPUTS of `expo prebuild`, not sources. Everything
# this app decides about them lives in `app.config.ts`, the config plugins under
# `plugins/`, and the autolinked local modules under `modules/` — the generated
# projects carry no edit that is not written from one of those on every run.
#
# There is no exception below on purpose: a file that has to survive a
# regeneration is a file a plugin must write.
/ios/
/android/
